# PointChat Features & Fixes

## 1. Message Routing & Group Management
- [ ] Fix message routing so `@user #group message` arrives to all recipients
- [ ] Implement group member lazy addition: `#group @user` adds missing user to existing group
- [ ] Implement atomic group send: `#group @user "message"` sends to all

## 2. Focus Mode & Chat Expansion
- [ ] Fix focus mode dropping on long press
- [ ] Implement auto-focus/expand for chat
- [ ] Mark messages as read automatically when chat is expanded

## 3. Settings & UI Modifications
- [ ] Remove "Reduce Motion" setting and associated logic
- [ ] Enhance Chat Security PIN setup UI to look more professional
- [ ] Add visual indicator showing if PIN is already set

## 4. Navigation & Animations
- [ ] Modify swipe interactions across the app to bounce back instead of swiping fully to end

## 5. Online Status Indicators
- [ ] Fix online ring for individual users
- [ ] Implement partial completion ring for groups (completion % = online members / total members)
